{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "1bb61ff7893609bb9c2ffb53a92022eef7ffc412b94970bb02e7e788895af3cf", "ja": "Manyバルーン◎", "zh": "Many气球◎", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7b58f6d8e974b1e65940232afcca75df432ff132416121e8ddc6cfd00b8b281a", "ja": "記念式典の日。会場には幅広い年代の人々が\n集まった。この公園が愛されている事を改め\nて感じる一同。集まった皆によるバルーンリ\nリースが行われ、晴天の空の下に風船が舞う\n中、公園を救うためのライブが始まった！", "zh": "纪念典礼当天，会场聚集了各个年龄段的人们。\n大家再次感受到这座公园是多么受人喜爱。\n聚集而来的人们一起放飞气球，在晴朗的天空下\n气球翩翩飞舞之中，为拯救公园的演唱会开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1000_okyakusantati", "source_sha256": "476c0035eeb801024a0779df701b5773782d97df2a0e8ebe70e87af9526f4e3d", "ja": "ワイワイ、ガヤガヤ……", "zh": "热闹喧哗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "df785025badbc1e9c5758e84c5bcb5617982a55f9ecfd39effa832a59b5e17e6", "ja": "（今日は記念式典イベント当日。亜美達のパレードに、\nかなりの人が集まっている。ライブも期待できそうだ）", "zh": "（今天是纪念典礼活动当天。亚美她们的游行吸引了相当多的人，看来演唱会也很令人期待）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "23f8cc95f07229f7f7fffedd455c06752615f3a053fb51619cf046caa7eb712a", "ja": "みんな、そろそろ準備を……。\nあれ、このみさんだけですか？　みんなは？", "zh": "大家差不多该准备了……  \n咦，只有这美小姐在吗？大家呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "afe3059de5cce5f5fb69bb6e1baf5f61b75ee30dce365eb6fd6f58f310696922", "ja": "客席の様子を見てくるって言ってたわよ。\nすぐ戻ってくるんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "她们说要去看看观众席的情况呢。\n应该马上就会回来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "f255a68cfa911e6cd90a5706e5db381b0c732cae0ed52d5f989f7f32d7756a3a", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃん、おかえり～ん！\n遅かったじゃーん？", "zh": "啊，哥哥，欢迎回来～！\n你回来得真晚呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3a5bceb10788ba67eb04fa33d948c04581aa69e5016643cff8c1feb6aad91429", "ja": "いや、それはこっちのセリフだけど。\n客席はどうだった？", "zh": "不，这话该我说才对吧。\n观众席那边情况怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "443e0840a966de12d9e6a5ab94944337e6bb8107debeda61513a43a11beebf85", "ja": "メッチャいろんな人来てるっぽいよ～！\nえっと……コンニャク弾正！", "zh": "好像来了超多各种各样的人哦～！\n呃……男女老少！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fb0d972118631cb8923167957010c388f476a59d3a483fe54fc5d8f923f9d95e", "ja": "老若男女な。\nでも、いろんな人が来てくれてるんだな。よかった。", "zh": "男女老少都有呢。不过，能有这么多人来，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "d47033642eb4c093be5e3a76e005aa07decc0334c5ef2879cf733d9ff496cb1f", "ja": "うん。カップルとか、家族連れもいたよ。\nふっふっふ、茜ちゃんの策が見事にハマったね！", "zh": "嗯。也有情侣，还有全家一起来的哦。\n呼呼呼，小茜的计策完全奏效了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "7a4b3ed9261ca48c254456db8d53b3a148a008ffcd398a0558cc02e2c6af1e6d", "ja": "こないだの子たちも、みんな来てくれてさ！\nすっげー手振ってくれたんだぜ♪", "zh": "之前那些孩子也都来捧场了！\n还拼命朝我挥手呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9ab18781225a34ea08a751ef1bf9e374ee6d941a0b8ec7400f52fe71dcc0a177", "ja": "近所の人達も、たくさん来てくれてるみたいだな。\n後はイベントとライブを、楽しんでもらうだけだ！", "zh": "看样子附近的居民也来了不少。\n接下来就只要让他们好好享受活动和演唱会了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "8a5f37a2aac797015bf4ec5d6df5b0485b3f64baac46bc080b1a2c259f052555", "ja": "望むトコロテンだよ、兄ちゃん！\n亜美たちが、最高に盛り上げるかんね！", "zh": "这正是亚美想要的，哥哥！\n亚美她们会把气氛炒到最高的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3921efd15218de9db7464466039802a59102b2a7fb78350af0fb47aebcd4b66f", "ja": "よし、もうすぐ時間だから、段取りを確認しておこう。\nまず最初は、茜だな。", "zh": "好，快到时间了，来确认一下流程吧。\n首先是茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "8fdfd0ebb6bbd1a688dd3b352269ef2da709f1ce2520decd72d86cd812ea6314", "ja": "お客さんたちと、一斉にバルーンリリースでしょ？\nたくさんの風船が空に舞えば、SNS映え間違いなし！", "zh": "要和客人们一起放飞气球，对吧？\n大量气球飞上天空，肯定能在社交平台上刷屏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "5916e8767e08c0d3661a3ec9aeb91b002374cffb0277fd7c74e57af2ecc83a98", "ja": "そんで、MC中にバンドの演奏が始まるから、\nオレらはそれに合わせて歌い始める。だよな？", "zh": "然后在主持环节乐队开始演奏，我们就配合着唱起来。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "952822947f498190deb70f8d192f72b167c3fce54832d21f2598a0a2c3bfffdc", "ja": "バンドのリハーサル、面白かったよね！\n亜美たちも負けないくらい、全力で歌うっしょ～！", "zh": "乐队的彩排很有意思吧！\n我们也要全力歌唱，绝不能输给他们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "88c7367bc7d7db220ff5e387012b3f6d55bfa303e10bdf63ac471767a343282d", "ja": "ふふっ、みんなバッチリみたいね。\nね、{$P$}！", "zh": "呵呵，大家好像都准备得相当完美呢。\n对吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "dd8a286fdd96e4d94ea3f79cfda8fa7873f05c0dd1bdf447dc59e37301f70596", "ja": "はは、そうですね。もう何も言うことはないな。\nみんな、最後まで楽しんでこい！", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。已经没什么好说的了。\n大家，尽情享受到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "290feee14b9abf39314805ee0a6bf5f801170b44d7a600794b8ecf5ea4f1a2db", "ja": "はーいっ♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "0e69cbe427cfe33a5a8d137a69983669700e533d708d89dbc41bb0dd0b2120d6", "ja": "会場のみんなー！　風船の準備はいーい？\nそれじゃ、いっせーの……はいっ！", "zh": "会场的各位——气球都准备好了吗？\n那么，一、二——开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1023_okyakusantati", "source_sha256": "04eb8f92f96d9b1b0dda15d7a43b28d731dfa07172d7ac83aca2515f7a4980f1", "ja": "ワアァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "ff6e91605845cc2a506af472d569637467cec9bc3bf4a21ee91b5344b56d7f20", "ja": "わぁ……！\nすっげー、メチャクチャきれいだよ！", "zh": "哇……！\n好厉害，超级漂亮啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "a3c11a6fee9edd68d2654455cf5a82938521a2ca112ad6f1ef5ba11493976f18", "ja": "本当に、綺麗……！", "zh": "真的，好漂亮……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "bc8ce1aadf78df4eef971080204b388a5c7fa3e35fb1820027076a6d90f00899", "ja": "ひゃっほー！　バズる、これはバズるよ！\nほらほらみんな、画像を撮って今すぐアップだ～！", "zh": "呀呼——！这绝对会火，肯定会火！\n快快快，大家拍下照片，现在马上上传～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1027_okyakusantati", "source_sha256": "05f3cb1cb9f2fcb8cdf5e4eef20fb01c79fb30928b2fa71c70f8e2618125a211", "ja": "ワァァァァッ……！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "3fd7f605196b1a8d6a583f5f41af2aaadc4a3d4bf6115114f6728fea54f3e1a3", "ja": "亜美ね、昔、この公園でよく遊んだんだ～！\nそういう人、他にもたくさんいるっしょ？", "zh": "亚美以前经常在这个公园玩呢～！\n像亚美这样的人，肯定还有很多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1029_011ami", "source_sha256": "bea894d27251f9098acb7d5bf23a3be790db0f3ab4c1793ce02c16809e7633c3", "ja": "公園が大好きなみんな！\n亜美たちと一緒に、メチャ盛り上がっていってねー！", "zh": "最喜欢公园的大家！\n和亜美我们一起嗨个痛快吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "c9b105e14fffa6436a183cf8ea9e519e4aac6b121e263253d6f8b37c4cde8e6d", "ja": "（みんな、空を見上げて、目を輝かせている……。\nきっと今日は、忘れられない思い出になるだろう！）", "zh": "（大家都仰望着天空，眼睛闪闪发亮……\n今天一定会成为一段难忘的回忆吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
